   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## FSoV determinant and normalization\n\nLet $\\langle f\\rangle_\\alpha$ be the contour integral around **all six** poles $\\theta_s+nh$ ($s=1,2$, $n=0,1,2$) of\n$$\nM(u)=\\frac{1}{\\nu_1(u)\\nu_2(u)\\nu_3(u)},\\qquad\n\\langle f\\rangle_\\alpha=\\sum_{\\rm poles\\ p}\\operatorname{Res}_{u=p}\\,M(u)\\,e^{2\\pi i(\\alpha-1)u/h}f(u).\n$$\nThe bare measure is $\\alpha=1$; $\\alpha=2$ carries the $h$-periodic factor. Rows are $(\\alpha,i,j)$ with $\\alpha\\in\\{1,2\\}$ and $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,1),(1,2),(2,1)\\}$ (the L=1 triple). Columns are $(r,\\beta)$, $\\beta=0,1$:\n$$\nu^\\beta\\bigl(-Q_A^jQ_{B,i},\\;Q_A^jQ_{B,i}^{[-2]},\\;Q_A^{j[2]}Q_{B,i}\\bigr).\n$$\n\nThe reference coefficient is the L=1 one, multiplied over both inhomogeneities (both terms kept, no on-shell simplification):\n$$\nc_A^{\\rm ref}=\\prod_{\\alpha=1}^2\\frac{1}{4h^6}\\Big[\nQ^1_A(\\theta_\\alpha+h)\\bigl(Q^1_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^2_A(\\theta_\\alpha+h)-Q^2_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^1_A(\\theta_\\alpha+h)\\bigr)\n-Q^1_A(\\theta_\\alpha)\\bigl(Q^1_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^2_A(\\theta_\\alpha+2h)-Q^2_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^1_A(\\theta_\\alpha+2h)\\bigr)\\Big],\n$$\n$$\n\\Psi_B^{\\rm ref}\n=\\prod_{\\alpha=1}^2 Q_{B,1}(\\theta_\\alpha+h)\n \\bigl[Q_{B,1}(\\theta_\\alpha)Q_{B,2}(\\theta_\\alpha-h)-Q_{B,2}(\\theta_\\alpha)Q_{B,1}(\\theta_\\alpha-h)\\bigr].\n$$\n\nNo sum over wave functions is used. The normalized determinant is\n$$\n{\\cal S}_Q(A,B)=C_{\\rm vac}\n\\frac{\\det N^{AB}}{c_A^{\\rm ref}\\Psi_B^{\\rm ref}},\n\\qquad\n{\\cal S}_Q({\\rm vac},{\\rm vac})=1.\n$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 5. 6x6 FSoV determinant, normalized by the product L=1 coefficient. ---- *)\nClearAll[\n    measurePoles2,\n    measureWeights2,\n    rowTriple2,\n    rowKeys2,\n    periodicFactor2,\n    determinantRow2,\n    determinantMatrix2,\n    crossRelative2,\n    cReferenceLocal2,\n    cReference2,\n    rawQScalar2,\n    vacuumConstant2,\n    qScalar2,\n    matchResidual2,\n    diagonalRelative2\n];\n\n(* All six poles of M = 1/(nu1 nu2 nu3), both ladders: every bracket is one\n   contour around both ladders, not a per-site sum. *)\nmeasurePoles2 = Flatten @ Table[thetaValues〚site〛 + n hValue, {site, 2}, {n, 0, 2}];\nmeasureWeights2 = Table[1 / Times @@ (measurePoles2〚r〛 - Delete[measurePoles2, r]), {r, Length[measurePoles2]}];\n\n(* Rows (alpha,i,j): the L=1 triple once for the bare measure (alpha=1) and\n   once with the h-periodic insertion Exp[2 Pi I u/h] (alpha=2). *)\nrowTriple2 = {{1, 1}, {1, 2}, {2, 1}};\nrowKeys2 = Flatten[Table[{alpha, ij}, {alpha, 2}, {ij, rowTriple2}], 1];\nperiodicFactor2[alpha_, x_] := Exp[2 Pi I (alpha - 1) SetPrecision[x, precisionL2] / hValue];\n\n(* Columns (r,beta): the three L=1 structures -Q^j Q_i, Q^j Q_i^[-2],\n   Q^j[2] Q_i, each with the insertion u^beta, beta = 0,1. *)\ndeterminantRow2[A_, B_, {alpha_, {i_, j_}}] :=\n    Sum[\n        With[\n            {x = measurePoles2〚r〛},\n            With[\n                {\n                    qa = qLeft2[statesQ2〚A〛, j, x],\n                    qap = qLeft2[statesQ2〚A〛, j, x + hValue],\n                    qb = qRight2[statesQ2〚B〛, i, x],\n                    qbm = qRight2[statesQ2〚B〛, i, x - hValue]\n                },\n                measureWeights2〚r〛 periodicFactor2[alpha, x] Flatten @ Table[x^beta{-qa qb, qa qbm, qap qb}, {beta, 0, 1}]\n            ]\n        ],\n        {r, Length[measurePoles2]}\n    ];\n\ndeterminantMatrix2 = Table[Det[determinantRow2[A, B, #]& /@ rowKeys2], {A, dchain}, {B, dchain}];\ncrossRelative2 = Max[Abs[determinantMatrix2 - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[determinantMatrix2]]]] / Min[Abs[Diagonal[determinantMatrix2]]];\n\n(* The L=1 reference coefficient at inhomogeneity th, both terms kept\n   (no on-shell simplification); the L=2 coefficient is its product over sites. *)\ncReferenceLocal2[S_, th_] :=\n    With[\n        {qu = qLeft2[S, #1, th + #2hValue]&},\n        (qu[1, 1] (qu[1, 0] qu[2, 1] - qu[2, 0] qu[1, 1]) - qu[1, 0] (qu[1, 0] qu[2, 2] - qu[2, 0] qu[1, 2])) / (4 hValue^6)\n    ];\ncReference2 = Table[Product[cReferenceLocal2[statesQ2〚A〛, th], {th, thetaValues}], {A, dchain}];\n\nrawQScalar2 = determinantMatrix2 / Outer[Times, cReference2, psiRightReference2];\nvacuumConstant2 = 1 / rawQScalar2〚vacuumState2, vacuumState2〛;\nqScalar2 = vacuumConstant2 rawQScalar2;\nmatchResidual2 = Table[Max[Abs[qScalar2 - physicalScalar2[q]]], {q, 2}];\ndiagonalRelative2 = Table[Max[Abs[Diagonal[qScalar2] - Diagonal[physicalScalar2[q]]] / Abs[Diagonal[physicalScalar2[q]]]], {q, 2}];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"rows (alpha,{i,j})\", rowKeys2},\n        {\"max |off-diagonal det| / min |diagonal det|\", N[crossRelative2, 6]},\n        {\"all 64 c_A^ref nonzero: min |c_A^ref|\", N[Min[Abs[cReference2]], 6]},\n        {\"vacuum calibration C_vac\", N[vacuumConstant2, 12]},\n        {\"Q determinant vacuum entry\", N[qScalar2〚vacuumState2, vacuumState2〛, 12]},\n        {\"branch I: max |S_Q - S_vec| over 64x64\", N[matchResidual2〚1〛, 6]},\n        {\"branch II: max |S_Q - S_vec| over 64x64\", N[matchResidual2〚2〛, 6]},\n        {\"branch I / II: max relative diagonal residual\", N[diagonalRelative2, 6]},\n        {\"range of |S_Q(A,A)|\", N[MinMax[Abs[Diagonal[qScalar2]]], 6]},\n        {\"first eight diagonal values: S_Q vs S_vec (branch I)\", N[Transpose[{Diagonal[qScalar2]〚1;;8〛, Diagonal[physicalScalar2[1]]〚1;;8〛}], 10]}\n    },\n    Frame → All,\n    Alignment → Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
