       "data": "Out[82]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rows (alpha,\\{i,j\\})} & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\\\1 & \\left\\{1,2\\right\\}\\\\1 & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\\\2 & \\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\\\2 & \\left\\{1,2\\right\\}\\\\2 & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{max |off-diagonal det| / min |diagonal det|} & 2.99217\\times 10^{-66}\\\\\\hline\\text{all 64 c\\_A\\^{}ref nonzero: min |c\\_A\\^{}ref|} & 2.48482\\times 10^{-13}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum calibration C\\_vac} & -2.43020022499\\times 10^{-6}+6.15410276892\\times 10^{-7}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\\\\\hline\\text{Q determinant vacuum entry} & 1.\\,+0.\\times 10^{-12}\\,\\mathrm{i}\\\\\\hline\\text{branch I: max |S\\_Q - S\\_vec| over 64x64} & 4.24238\\times 10^{-76}\\\\\\hline\\text{branch II: max |S\\_Q - S\\_vec| over 64x64} & 4.24238\\times 10^{-76}\\\\\\hline\\text{branch I / II: max relative diagonal residual} & \\left\\{0.\\times 10^{-72},0.\\times 10^{-72}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{range of |S\\_Q(A,A)|} & \\left\\{1.45058\\times 10^{-8},1877.84\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{first eight diagonal values: S\\_Q vs S\\_vec (branch I)} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\,+0.\\times 10^{-10}\\,\\mathrm{i} & 1.\\,\\\\0.0007167214426+0.\\times 10^{-13}\\,\\mathrm{i} & 0.0007167214426\\\\-0.0001521606480+0.\\times 10^{-14}\\,\\mathrm{i} & -0.0001521606480\\… [latex truncated: 1557 chars total]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "76dd463a-76fe-4017-9090-c1edfa8012d8"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Final relations\n\nFor both sites use the same one-site reference covector/vector. The two admissible branches are exactly the L=1 relations:\n$$\nb_{21}=-\\frac{z_1(z_1-z_3)}{a_{12}z_2(z_2-z_3)},\\qquad\nb_{32}=-\\frac{z_2^2(z_1-z_3)}\n {a_{23}(z_1-z_2)z_3^2}.\n$$\n\nBranch I:\n$$\nb_{31}=-\\frac{z_1^2}{a_{13}z_3^2},\\qquad\n\\frac{a_{12}a_{23}}{a_{13}}\n=-\\frac{z_2(z_1-z_3)}{z_1(z_2-z_3)}.\n$$\n\nBranch II:\n$$\nb_{31}=-\\frac{z_1}{a_{13}z_3},\\qquad\n\\frac{a_{12}a_{23}}{a_{13}}\n=-\\frac{z_1-z_3}{z_2-z_3}.\n$$\n\nThe preceding cell checks, at 90-digit precision and the chain point $\\theta=(1/3,-8/57)$, $h=1$, unimodular $z=(5/2,7/3,6/35)$, that\n$$\n\\frac{\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle}{\\langle\\Psi_A|0\\rangle\\langle0|\\Psi_B\\rangle}={\\cal S}_Q(A,B)\n$$\nfor all $64\\times64$ pairs and both branches: every cross-state determinant vanishes and every diagonal entry agrees.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Invariance under the choice of Q-functions in the rows\n\nReplace the L=1 triple by any $\\{(a,c),(a,d),(b,c)\\}$ with $a\\ne b$, $c\\ne d$ (36 triples); the direct content of the rows is $\\{a,a,b\\}$ and the dual content $\\{c,c,d\\}$, again repeated for $\\alpha=1,2$. The normalization follows the Q-functions used:\n$$\n\\Psi_B^{{\\rm ref},(a,b)}=\\prod_{\\alpha}Q_{B,a}(\\theta_\\alpha+h)\\bigl[Q_{B,a}(\\theta_\\alpha)Q_{B,b}(\\theta_\\alpha-h)-Q_{B,b}(\\theta_\\alpha)Q_{B,a}(\\theta_\\alpha-h)\\bigr],\n$$\n$$\nc_A^{{\\rm ref},(c,d)}=\\prod_{\\alpha}\\frac{1}{4h^6}\\Big[Q^c_A(\\theta_\\alpha+h)\\bigl(Q^c_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^d_A(\\theta_\\alpha+h)-Q^d_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^c_A(\\theta_\\alpha+h)\\bigr)-Q^c_A(\\theta_\\alpha)\\bigl(Q^c_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^d_A(\\theta_\\alpha+2h)-Q^d_A(\\theta_\\alpha)Q^c_A(\\theta_\\alpha+2h)\\bigr)\\Big].\n$$\nFor each triple, ${\\cal S}_Q$ is vacuum-normalized separately and compared with the same physical $64\\times64$ matrix.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Every admissible row triple, with its own normalization. ---- *)\nClearAll[rowCache2, triples2, psiRefLocalGen2, cRefLocalGen2, tripleData2,\n  tripleTable2, logAbs2];\n\n(* All 18 rows (alpha,{i,j}) for every ordered pair of states, computed once;\n   each triple only selects six of them. *)\nrowCache2 = Table[\n   AssociationMap[determinantRow2[A, B, #] &,\n    Flatten[Table[{alpha, {i, j}}, {alpha, 2}, {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 2]],\n   {A, dchain}, {B, dchain}];\n\ntriples2 = Flatten[Table[\n    If[a != b && c != d, {{a, c}, {a, d}, {b, c}}, Nothing],\n    {a, 3}, {b, 3}, {c, 3}, {d, 3}], 3];\n\npsiRefLocalGen2[S_, th_, a_, b_] :=\n  qRight2[S, a, th + hValue] (\n    qRight2[S, a, th] qRight2[S, b, th - hValue]\n    - qRight2[S, b, th] qRight2[S, a, th - hValue]);\ncRefLocalGen2[S_, th_, c_, d_] := With[{qu = qLeft2[S, #1, th + #2 hValue] &},\n   (qu[c, 1] (qu[c, 0] qu[d, 1] - qu[d, 0] qu[c, 1])\n     - qu[c, 0] (qu[c, 0] qu[d, 2] - qu[d, 0] qu[c, 2]))/(4 hValue^6)];\n\n(* log10 of a residual; an arbitrary-precision zero 0``p is reported as -p. *)\nlogAbs2[x_] := If[x == 0, -Accuracy[x], Log10[Abs[x]]];\n\ntripleData2[tr_] := Module[\n  {a = tr[[1, 1]], b = tr[[3, 1]], c = tr[[1, 2]], d = tr[[2, 2]],\n   keys, dets, psi, cref, diagDets, raw, cvac, qs, cross, res},\n  keys = Flatten[Table[{alpha, ij}, {alpha, 2}, {ij, tr}], 1];\n  dets = Table[Det[Lookup[rowCache2[[A, B]], keys]], {A, dchain}, {B, dchain}];\n  psi = Table[Product[psiRefLocalGen2[statesQ2[[B]], th, a, b],\n     {th, thetaValues}], {B, dchain}];\n  cref = Table[Product[cRefLocalGen2[statesQ2[[A]], th, c, d],\n     {th, thetaValues}], {A, dchain}];\n  diagDets = Abs[Diagonal[dets]];\n  cross = Max[Abs[dets - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[dets]]]]/Min[diagDets];\n  (* The diagonal determinants can span ~50 orders of magnitude for a single\n     triple (with Psi^ref c^ref spanning the same), so only exact zeros count. *)\n  If[AnyTrue[Join[diagDets, Abs[psi], Abs[cref]], # == 0 &],\n   <|\"triple\" -> tr, \"ok\" -> False|>,\n   raw = dets/Outer[Times, cref, psi];\n   cvac = 1/raw[[vacuumState2, vacuumState2]];\n   qs = cvac raw;\n   res = Table[Max[Abs[qs - physicalScalar2[q]]]/\n      Max[Abs[Diagonal[physicalScalar2[q]]]], {q, 2}];\n   <|\"triple\" -> tr, \"ok\" -> True, \"cross\" -> cross,\n     \"diagSpread\" -> Min[diagDets]/Max[diagDets],\n     \"Cvac\" -> cvac, \"res\" -> res|>]];\n\ntripleTable2 = tripleData2 /@ triples2;\n\nGrid[Join[\n   {{\"rows {(a,c),(a,d),(b,c)}\", \"no zero norm / Psi^ref / c^ref\",\n     \"log10 max|cross det|/min|diag det|\", \"log10 min/max |diag det|\",\n     \"C_vac / C_vac(L=1 triple)\", \"log10 rel. 64x64 residual (I, II)\"}},\n   Table[{r[\"triple\"], r[\"ok\"],\n     If[r[\"ok\"], Round[logAbs2[r[\"cross\"]]], \"-\"],\n     If[r[\"ok\"], Round[logAbs2[r[\"diagSpread\"]]], \"-\"],\n     If[r[\"ok\"], N[r[\"Cvac\"]/tripleTable2[[1, \"Cvac\"]], 8], \"-\"],\n     If[r[\"ok\"], Round[logAbs2 /@ r[\"res\"]], \"-\"]}, {r, tripleTable2}],\n   {{\"summary: triples passing / worst log10 residual / worst |C_vac ratio - 1|\",\n     Count[tripleTable2[[All, \"ok\"]], True],\n     Max[Round[logAbs2 /@ Flatten[Select[tripleTable2, #[\"ok\"] &][[All, \"res\"]]]]],\n     SpanFromLeft,\n     N[Max[Abs[Select[tripleTable2, #[\"ok\"] &][[All, \"Cvac\"]]/\n          tripleTable2[[1, \"Cvac\"]] - 1]], 3], SpanFromLeft}}],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752600\" data-output-id=\"11\" data-out-n=\"99\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"52\" data-sub-end=\"67\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[99]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"31\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:132.0407em;vertical-align:-65.7504em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:66.2904em;\"><span style=\"top:-68.2504em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:68.2504em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:132.0007em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-65.7504em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:66.2504em;\"><span style=\"top:-69.4604em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rows {(a,c),(a,d),(b,c)}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-67.0504em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3